#> tool: sedrepl
#> wait: 8 lemons 22
#> pause: 45
#> must: 2 bananas 30
#> must: 8 lemons 22
#> not: 1 apples 12
#> source: 0,/a/d
# 18. 0,addr2. Sheet: start out in the "matched first address" state, until addr2 is
# found. A range 1,/a/ begins on line 1 and looks for /a/ only from line 2 on, so it
# would delete apples AND bananas. 0,/a/ lets line 1 itself end the range: the first
# line with an a, whatever its number, is the whole range. Only apples is deleted.
# Try: change 0 to 1 and watch bananas disappear as well.
0,/a/d

#DATA
1 apples 12
2 bananas 30
3 cherries 7
4 dates 16
5 figs 25
6 grapes 40
7 kiwis 18
8 lemons 22
